NULL-code row, EMI×2, 0-credit×2, Wed-56 course, Mon-AB course):
  total/paging        12 rows → total=12, per_page=50, page=1 all 12, page=2 total=12 items=[]
  default year_sem    omitted → freshest semester in catalog (9999 during seeding) total=12
  q (name)            q=資料 → {資料結構}
  q (teacher)         q=張美玲 → {微積分(一), 機率論}; q=international (name_en, case-insens.) → {國際企業管理}
  dept                資訊工程學系 → total=3, all dept equal
  grade               grade=1 → total=6, all grade='1'
  credit              credit=0 → 2 (電磁學, 游泳); credit=3 → 7
  compulsory          true → 5 / false → 7 (bool strict: maybe → 400)
  english             true → 2 (EMI) / false → 10
  weekday alone       weekday=1 → 3; weekday=5 → {電磁學} (day slot non-empty)
  weekday+period      weekday=3&period=5 → {資料結構} ONLY (Wed-56 hits; Mon-AB 作業系統 excluded);
                      weekday=1&period=A → {作業系統}
